  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$(x-1)^3+8=0 \\Rightarrow(x-1)=(-2)(1)^{1 / 3}$ $\\Rightarrow x-1=-2$ or $-2 \\omega$ or $-2 \\omega^2$ or $n=-1$ or $1-2 \\omega$ or $1-2 \\omega^2$."
  }
